  "body": "## Changes\r\n\r\n* feat(BREAKING): support checksums on extends and only configure process plugins from trusted configuration (#1396)\r\n* fix(BREAKING): don't let associations or remote negated excludes override the gitignore (#1393)\r\n* feat: update npm specifiers in extends with dprint config update (#1464)\r\n* feat: let plugins say whether they format a range (#1422)\r\n* feat: add permissions to `dprint lsp` to prevent editor from downloading from untrusted sources and to prevent running process plugins without approval (#1408)\r\n* feat: publish a signed packslip with each release (#1407)\r\n* feat(BREAKING): restrict process plugins override config (#1397, #1457)\r\n* fix: only allow npm package names that npm allows (#1402)\r\n* fix: explain a missing dynamic loader when a process plugin fails to start (#1403)\r\n* fix: report a wasm plugin running out of stack as an error for the file, and give wasm 8 MiB of stack (#1463)\r\n* fix: respect `.git/info/exclude` in a linked git worktree and a submodule (#1462)\r\n\r\n## Install\r\n\r\nRun `dprint upgrade` or see https://dprint.dev/install/\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\nThese artifacts have [build provenance attestations](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/security-for-github-actions/using-artifact-attestations/using-artifact-attestations-to-establish-provenance-for-builds).\r\nVerify a download with the [GitHub CLI](https://cli.github.com/):\r\n\r\n```shell\r\ngh attestation verify dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip --repo dprint/dprint\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe zips are also described by a signed [packslip](https://packslip.dev) (`packslip.sigstore.json`):\r\n\r\n```shell\r\npackslip verify packslip.sigstore.json --artifact dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Checksums\r\n\r\n|Artifact|SHA-256 Checksum|\r\n|:--|:--|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-apple-darwin.zip|b94e2ede59904f34f8047ee9f069767acf19df389b3983f4b97a4fd64f5fcf15|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-apple-darwin.zip|5e57a5e75f5d29d1f9dcc10255fccb9815031f4720fe6759643d0ee12cf201f2|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip|83bc6c5df42d6001062a71ac475ceb5be119472af6afb3fce52ff13ed042db77|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc-installer.exe|afd9750f7fcce375f8e26618a9ec7aff8bbcb6206f934763ea957510d355f2de|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc.zip|350e2e9c021f5f034796de9330a665346d50b72de892d04bb85db0d073b39112|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|d1aaf0c6d015931b860804eda5bf7fac9d29e2253351b7d6b0177e6b03a8776d|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|61707303f4305891fecffec1f92ec8243b07e9d3ba8a7e81f7543fc77fb0002d|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|804535e54f431674f5481725ba5d4718de0a7398d6abd33b899fd734f6d98062|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|a427ef844b300d896b3f836706bb77d8df6b77f8f2627103c4a34ded94cf6ae1|\r\n|dprint-riscv64gc-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|d01a42eee2853c0dc9f82ac4a0936caf1697df7ff110ac293150590af37765c3|\r\n|dprint-riscv64gc-unknown-linux-musl.zip|bf9c8bb9d8e645f02730569b227fc29b78b289c3b141321ed1d5f0842d2adccc|\r\n|dprint-s390x-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|b8a2a4e9682b5c50e578ae728d475ff975b22b347f90840cb9f7029c204a8b51|\r\n|dprint-loongarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|549ad89d5047f5dba1f2697f6e64523055ca970faa1251ad794d185140892f70|\r\n|dprint-loongarch64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|4aa4207d7739d17870959279652e9c16c2bdadb089bc073343065a7d492afd76|\r\n|dprint-powerpc64le-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|66de75206b1b5605a9c9f22d5e74a6ae140d78e6886977d1402d3243c43160b6|\r\n|dprint-powerpc64le-unknown-linux-musl.zip|3bcaec88382d72d40c774f8e610371d3842b72497d179723fcbe1dfed09040e1|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-linux-android.zip|42145b20fe651bad58ce8a01473bbf6bf7c50447012311c329642c409927e1f6|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-linux-android.zip|fc801196d0a437284d62047d586d74c53b42aa1f2fcd6e4139612eddff554564|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-unknown-freebsd.zip|ea508181562fcabaee8f684b006344f6213b1cbe0659cfd5f5584c55f703ddf6|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-unknown-freebsd.zip|843a286b93db221e70d94f7f991f5a053f02222391de9eb15ab755f6c1be2b5b|\r\n"
